WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 36= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
02:10.630 --> 02:14.080
Keep your wrist straight.

8
02:15.240 --> 02:16.430
Don't let it droop.

9
02:18.520 --> 02:19.870
And don't bend it upward.

10
02:26.590 --> 02:27.590
Aim.

11
02:29.400 --> 02:30.400
Once you've taken aim,

12
02:31.750 --> 02:32.910
don't overthink it.

13
02:36.960 --> 02:38.560
Keep your hand steady.

14
02:41.280 --> 02:43.190
Keep your elbow straight

15
02:44.520 --> 02:45.630
and locked in place.

16
02:46.430 --> 02:47.560
Don't let it shake.

17
02:48.300 --> 02:50.460
♪Hardship will always remain♪

18
02:50.460 --> 02:55.540
♪Amid treacherous waters, few make it to the end♪

19
02:55.900 --> 03:00.750
♪How could a thousand words soothe this aching heart?♪

20
03:00.750 --> 03:03.030
I'm not trying to take advantage of you.

21
03:03.870 --> 03:06.750
I just don't have any strength left.

22
03:09.520 --> 03:10.470
I know.

23
03:13.340 --> 03:18.780
♪Even if I only illuminate a single corner♪

24
03:18.780 --> 03:23.860
♪If I could bring light to someone's eyes♪

25
03:23.860 --> 03:32.340
♪I'd spend this life and call it courage♪

26
03:42.840 --> 03:44.800
Wei Bao and his men are seasoned soldiers.

27
03:45.680 --> 03:47.470
They'll find this place eventually.

28
03:49.360 --> 03:50.710
Don't worry about me.

29
03:52.190 --> 03:53.840
Get on the mule and go.

30
04:02.280 --> 04:03.360
Where would I go?

31
04:06.240 --> 04:07.630
If I survive,

32
04:09.520 --> 04:11.470
we'll meet again as husband and wife.

33
04:14.150 --> 04:15.590
If I die,

34
04:18.000 --> 04:19.310
you should remarry.

35
04:24.750 --> 04:27.040
I used my power to get my way

36
04:28.600 --> 04:30.510
and took you from Han Liang

37
04:31.630 --> 04:34.190
against your will.

38
04:35.950 --> 04:37.430
I wronged you.

39
04:40.720 --> 04:41.600
Now,

40
04:42.390 --> 04:44.310
Han Liang still isn't betrothed,

41
04:46.190 --> 04:48.310
and you still can't forget him.

42
04:53.000 --> 04:54.310
You should marry him.

43
04:56.824 --> 04:58.630
I've never thought about Han Liang that way.

44
04:58.904 --> 05:00.950
How could I possibly still have feelings for him?

45
05:10.120 --> 05:11.120
You never

46
05:11.870 --> 05:13.720
had feelings for Han Liang?

47
05:24.000 --> 05:24.920
Lin Jinqi.

48
05:25.464 --> 05:27.000
You used your power to get your way

49
05:27.000 --> 05:27.992
and took what you wanted.

50
05:28.000 --> 05:29.090
You're not wrong about that.

51
05:30.560 --> 05:32.950
But this has nothing to do with Han Liang.

52
05:34.630 --> 05:36.000
What you took from me

53
05:36.160 --> 05:37.600
was my life.

54
05:38.800 --> 05:40.040
You ignored what I wanted

55
05:40.456 --> 05:41.720
and used an imperial decree

56
05:42.510 --> 05:43.920
to bind me to the Lin family.

57
05:51.800 --> 05:52.600
Back then,

58
05:53.920 --> 05:55.750
when you helped me register Ji'er,

59
05:56.190 --> 05:57.430
I made you a promise.

60
05:58.600 --> 06:00.630
If you ever needed my help,

61
06:01.720 --> 06:03.190
I would do everything in my power.

62
06:18.310 --> 06:19.190
Besides,

63
06:19.352 --> 06:20.950
our marriage was decreed by the Emperor.

64
06:22.160 --> 06:23.720
How could I possibly remarry?

65
06:27.720 --> 06:30.000
I'll write a memorial

66
06:31.630 --> 06:32.920
asking His Majesty

67
06:34.430 --> 06:35.830
to allow you to remarry.

68
06:40.360 --> 06:41.390
By then,

69
06:41.430 --> 06:42.510
who knows which emperor

70
06:42.510 --> 06:43.920
will be sitting on the throne?

71
06:48.070 --> 06:49.240
If it's Prince Han,

72
06:50.830 --> 06:52.630
I'll just have to be beheaded with you.

73
07:01.920 --> 07:02.560
All right.

74
07:02.630 --> 07:03.830
Stop imagining the worst.

75
07:04.720 --> 07:06.920
If you have the energy, you should eat something.

76
07:13.310 --> 07:14.800
I brought you hot water,

77
07:15.190 --> 07:16.120
but it froze.

78
07:22.168 --> 07:23.070
The flatbread is hard.

79
07:23.160 --> 07:25.032
Let it soften in your mouth before you eat it.

80
07:34.390 --> 07:35.390
Why

81
07:36.360 --> 07:38.160
didn't you boil a couple of eggs?

82
07:41.190 --> 07:42.190
Young Master Lin,

83
07:42.510 --> 07:44.040
in weather this cold,

84
07:45.120 --> 07:46.390
hens don't lay eggs.

85
07:46.680 --> 07:47.950
For an ordinary farming family,

86
07:48.190 --> 07:49.600
even this little brown sugar

87
07:49.630 --> 07:52.024
is something they only buy when a woman has just given birth.

88
08:41.000 --> 08:42.030
You're even hotter now.

89
08:55.840 --> 08:56.910
I'll go see if I can find

90
08:56.960 --> 08:58.630
any herbs to bring down your fever.

91
09:38.630 --> 09:39.960
Let go of me!

92
09:42.440 --> 09:43.910
Help!

93
09:56.312 --> 09:58.568
You wretched woman! You don't know what's good for you!

94
09:58.728 --> 10:00.280
You're overestimating yourself!

95
10:03.080 --> 10:04.480
You've ruined my fun!

96
10:17.170 --> 10:18.050
Women in the capital

97
10:18.060 --> 10:19.840
could get us killed just for looking at them,

98
10:19.840 --> 10:21.390
let alone touching them.

99
10:21.870 --> 10:23.120
We're in luck today.

100
10:23.320 --> 10:24.440
Let's have our fill of fun.

101
10:25.080 --> 10:25.750
My turn.

102
10:27.550 --> 10:28.550
Here I come.

103
10:35.510 --> 10:37.870
You beasts! I'll kill you!

104
10:46.000 --> 10:46.550
Come on!

105
10:46.670 --> 10:47.750
I'll kill you!

106
10:49.224 --> 10:50.270
Is that all you've got?

107
10:50.480 --> 10:51.000
I'm fine.

108
10:51.320 --> 10:52.390
She's just a woman.

109
11:00.200 --> 11:01.000
You beast!

110
11:03.630 --> 11:04.870
Still putting up a fight, huh?

111
11:05.000 --> 11:06.440
I'll make you regret it today!

112
11:06.440 --> 11:08.720
You beast! I'll kill you!

113
11:10.870 --> 11:11.670
Come on!

114
11:12.390 --> 11:13.120
Kill me.

115
11:13.960 --> 11:14.910
Go ahead and kill me!

116
11:15.510 --> 11:16.750
Let's see what you've got.

117
11:17.750 --> 11:18.360
Come on.

118
11:22.910 --> 11:25.600
You said you'd kill me. Still putting up a fight?

119
11:25.720 --> 11:27.390
I'll make you regret it today!

120
11:27.550 --> 11:28.630
Sweetheart.

121
11:29.200 --> 11:31.480
Come kill me!

122
11:39.550 --> 11:40.080
Who's there?

123
11:40.750 --> 11:41.320
Who is it?

124
11:56.630 --> 11:57.840
As you wish.

125
11:58.790 --> 12:00.440
I'll kill you.

126
12:52.910 --> 12:53.720
Madam Dai.

127
12:54.216 --> 12:55.390
What are you doing here?

128
13:01.816 --> 13:03.630
Why are you dressed like this, Madam Lin?

129
13:04.632 --> 13:06.000
Have you become a servant again?

130
13:15.900 --> 13:19.260
(Tiance Guards)

131
13:26.520 --> 13:27.840
Prince Han has been defeated.

132
13:36.808 --> 13:38.840
You and Zhao Xingluo fled the capital,

133
13:38.872 --> 13:40.616
only to run into bandits one after another.

134
13:41.030 --> 13:42.550
They took everything you had.

135
13:54.550 --> 13:55.720
Just as you said,

136
13:57.550 --> 13:58.840
the Zhao family is finished.

137
14:00.600 --> 14:02.000
The Dai family is finished, too.

138
14:03.030 --> 14:04.000
It's all over.

139
15:02.320 --> 15:03.360
After Prince Han's defeat,

140
15:04.184 --> 15:06.320
his remaining troops will scatter in all directions,

141
15:06.712 --> 15:08.080
robbing, burning, and killing.

142
15:08.488 --> 15:10.440
They'll be even more vicious than real bandits.

143
15:11.384 --> 15:13.256
You should leave this place as soon as possible

144
15:13.670 --> 15:14.750
and find somewhere to hide.

145
15:19.600 --> 15:20.670
This is where we part.

146
15:21.208 --> 15:22.504
May our paths never cross again.

147
16:44.480 --> 16:46.240
Go wherever you want.

148
16:46.840 --> 16:47.630
Stop following me.

149
16:51.240 --> 16:52.030
Madam Lin.

150
16:52.910 --> 16:54.080
It's freezing out here.

151
16:54.630 --> 16:55.720
Where can I possibly go?

152
16:57.240 --> 16:58.720
Go wherever you like.

153
16:59.016 --> 17:00.080
Just stop following me.

154
17:15.240 --> 17:16.310
What a coincidence.

155
17:17.240 --> 17:18.960
We've run into each other again, Madam Lin.

156
17:20.000 --> 17:20.960
It seems

157
17:21.704 --> 17:23.240
we happen to be going the same way.

158
17:54.590 --> 17:55.440
Lanxiang.

159
18:00.030 --> 18:01.070
Lanxiang.

160
18:14.960 --> 18:15.720
Wait for me.

161
18:17.830 --> 18:18.880
I can't keep up.

162
18:46.070 --> 18:46.640
So...

163
18:47.830 --> 18:49.310
you dressed worse than a servant

164
18:49.680 --> 18:51.440
all for this ungrateful man.

165
18:53.790 --> 18:55.200
Take my advice.

166
18:57.240 --> 18:57.960
Men

167
18:58.960 --> 19:00.480
are no good.

168
19:01.070 --> 19:03.110
Stop giving him your whole heart.

169
19:55.752 --> 19:57.000
Do you have anything to eat?

170
20:26.120 --> 20:27.160
Next time I have to flee,

171
20:27.400 --> 20:28.510
I'll know better.

172
20:29.550 --> 20:30.590
I can't just bring money.

173
20:31.128 --> 20:32.480
I'll need to bring some food, too.

174
20:34.070 --> 20:35.510
In times of war and chaos,

175
20:36.350 --> 20:38.110
even money can't buy you food.

176
20:49.510 --> 20:50.880
There's one thing you got wrong.

177
20:53.688 --> 20:55.160
I didn't keep running into bandits.

178
20:57.270 --> 20:58.400
Xingluo and I

179
21:01.000 --> 21:02.400
were abandoned by Master Zhao

180
21:04.000 --> 21:04.960
and Young Master Zhao

181
21:05.880 --> 21:07.240
halfway through our journey.

182
21:19.830 --> 21:21.310
They thought we

183
21:22.350 --> 21:23.400
were a burden.

184
21:26.110 --> 21:27.310
They killed Qingxiang,

185
21:28.640 --> 21:29.880
took my money,

186
21:30.880 --> 21:31.680
and fled.

187
21:33.310 --> 21:34.480
But guess what?

188
21:35.830 --> 21:38.070
Xingluo and I

189
21:38.168 --> 21:39.608
actually came across Master Zhao

190
21:39.720 --> 21:41.768
and Young Master Zhao's bodies along the way.

191
21:43.110 --> 21:45.270
They died even before I did.

192
22:11.480 --> 22:13.720
Thank you for killing the men who humiliated me

193
22:16.070 --> 22:17.350
and giving me bean cakes to eat.

194
22:53.720 --> 22:55.200
I have nothing left now.

195
23:03.000 --> 23:04.110
I'll give this to you.

196
23:07.510 --> 23:09.070
No one in the Lin family is any good.

197
23:09.880 --> 23:10.830
Keep this,

198
23:11.400 --> 23:13.432
and you'll have something to protect yourself with.

199
23:15.240 --> 23:16.590
Never mind Lin Jinqi.

200
23:17.550 --> 23:19.000
Even Lin Zhaoxiang

201
23:19.400 --> 23:20.590
would get down on his knees

202
23:21.750 --> 23:22.920
if you told him to.

203
23:27.590 --> 23:28.720
You don't believe me?

204
23:35.830 --> 23:37.960
This is evidence of Lin Jinqi's rebellion.

205
23:39.590 --> 23:41.270
Master Zhao and Young Master Zhao

206
23:41.350 --> 23:42.880
came all the way to the capital

207
23:43.240 --> 23:45.160
to present this evidence

208
23:45.590 --> 23:47.550
and claim credit from Old Master Zhao.

209
23:49.030 --> 23:52.000
Unfortunately, Prince Han launched his rebellion.

210
23:52.590 --> 23:55.110
Old Master Zhao remained in the imperial palace

211
23:55.200 --> 23:56.440
and never returned.

212
23:58.590 --> 23:59.510
The father and son

213
23:59.720 --> 24:00.640
thought I was still

214
24:00.640 --> 24:02.400
an illiterate fool.

215
24:03.240 --> 24:04.270
They let their guard down,

216
24:06.270 --> 24:07.750
so I secretly saw it.

217
24:12.328 --> 24:14.440
When news came that Prince Han had been defeated,

218
24:14.960 --> 24:15.720
we all

219
24:15.830 --> 24:17.510
fled the capital in a hurry.

220
24:20.960 --> 24:22.720
Master Zhao and Young Master Zhao

221
24:22.830 --> 24:23.880
died along the way.

222
24:24.830 --> 24:25.550
I hid

223
24:27.070 --> 24:28.480
this away.

224
24:29.070 --> 24:31.480
I thought I could either use it to save my life,

225
24:33.000 --> 24:33.640
or

226
24:34.960 --> 24:36.110
even if I died,

227
24:37.720 --> 24:39.070
I'd make sure the Lin family

228
24:40.110 --> 24:41.110
went down with me.

229
25:18.790 --> 25:20.070
You never would've guessed it.

230
25:24.000 --> 25:26.200
Lin Jinqi really was the wolf among them.

231
25:27.200 --> 25:28.920
He actually had the audacity

232
25:29.790 --> 25:32.070
to secretly let the deposed Crown Prince escape.

233
25:34.880 --> 25:35.750
About this,

234
25:35.880 --> 25:36.750
in this entire world,

235
25:37.384 --> 25:38.680
you're the only one who knows.

236
25:43.480 --> 25:44.960
Why are you giving this to me?

237
26:17.550 --> 26:18.550
I told you.

238
26:22.240 --> 26:24.110
Because you killed the men who humiliated me

239
26:27.830 --> 26:29.310
and gave me bean cakes to eat.

240
26:41.240 --> 26:44.008
But you don't seem like someone who repays kindness with kindness.

241
27:04.070 --> 27:05.160
I'm not.

242
27:06.830 --> 27:08.440
But when death is near,

243
27:09.656 --> 27:11.070
people tend to speak from the heart.

244
28:00.830 --> 28:03.070
I don't want to die alongside those beasts.

245
28:04.750 --> 28:06.110
Spending my final moments with you

246
28:09.200 --> 28:10.110
isn't so bad.

247
28:16.000 --> 28:16.480
Zhao...

248
28:20.480 --> 28:21.720
What should I call you?

249
28:24.350 --> 28:26.270
Can I call you Xingtang?

250
28:33.790 --> 28:36.310
You understand me even better than Qingxiang did.

251
28:50.640 --> 28:51.550
All my life,

252
28:53.832 --> 28:54.880
I've been Young Lady Zhao,

253
28:54.960 --> 28:55.830
and Madam Dai.

254
28:57.270 --> 28:58.510
I've had enough.

255
29:01.550 --> 29:02.790
I've truly had enough.

256
29:04.240 --> 29:05.200
When I die,

257
29:05.550 --> 29:07.440
just burn me to ashes.

258
29:12.160 --> 29:13.160
In my next life,

259
29:14.880 --> 29:15.750
I want to be myself,

260
29:17.240 --> 29:18.510
my own person.

261
29:19.592 --> 29:20.350
Do you understand?

262
29:23.110 --> 29:23.750
I do.

263
29:25.176 --> 29:26.240
I understand everything.

264
29:33.720 --> 29:34.720
I've learned to read.

265
29:36.240 --> 29:37.310
I've studied.

266
29:40.400 --> 29:41.110
But

267
29:42.824 --> 29:44.110
I still don't understand...

268
29:45.750 --> 29:47.720
Don't understand the rules of this world.

269
29:49.000 --> 29:49.720
Tell me,

270
29:50.830 --> 29:52.030
when will there

271
29:53.510 --> 29:55.480
ever be a world like that?

272
29:56.440 --> 29:58.240
Where girls, just like boys,

273
29:58.590 --> 29:59.920
can go to school,

274
30:01.816 --> 30:03.240
take the imperial examinations,

275
30:04.000 --> 30:04.790
serve as officials,

276
30:05.480 --> 30:06.350
do business,

277
30:06.936 --> 30:08.030
and earn their own money.

278
30:11.200 --> 30:11.920
Where women

279
30:12.640 --> 30:14.550
can choose their own husbands,

280
30:15.680 --> 30:18.790
without marriages arranged by parents and matchmakers.

281
30:19.608 --> 30:21.440
Where a wife doesn't have to obey her husband.

282
30:21.896 --> 30:23.464
She doesn't have to obey her husband

283
30:24.110 --> 30:25.160
or her son.

284
30:26.480 --> 30:27.550
She is simply herself.

285
30:32.200 --> 30:33.030
There will be.

286
30:37.480 --> 30:39.110
That world will come one day.

287
30:47.310 --> 30:49.270
If such a world truly existed,

288
30:50.160 --> 30:51.160
that would be wonderful.

289
30:53.790 --> 30:56.350
Then Qingxiang and I could

290
30:56.960 --> 30:58.960
earn our living openly

291
30:59.720 --> 31:02.880
and live with dignity.

292
31:15.270 --> 31:16.070
Lanxiang.

293
31:17.750 --> 31:19.400
Keep this evidence safe.

294
31:21.480 --> 31:23.440
The Lin family won't dare mistreat you.

295
31:23.440 --> 31:26.140
♪If there were a promise♪

296
31:26.620 --> 31:30.660
♪I could still turn down with a smile♪

297
31:31.100 --> 31:34.980
♪Sadly, my wish could not come true♪

298
31:35.590 --> 31:36.680
Live well.

299
31:39.300 --> 31:41.260
♪Those things I can't forget♪

300
31:41.720 --> 31:42.790
Live well...

301
31:42.790 --> 31:45.700
♪The absurdities I can't let go of fill every page♪

302
31:45.700 --> 31:47.700
♪Building a wall♪

303
31:47.700 --> 31:51.300
♪Trapped in the midst of time♪

304
31:51.300 --> 31:54.780
♪Drifting with the wind♪

305
31:56.020 --> 31:58.220
♪Memories hide away again♪

306
31:58.220 --> 31:59.900
♪Silent, yet♪

307
31:59.900 --> 32:02.860
♪They never stop shining♪

308
32:02.860 --> 32:04.740
♪Still burning bright♪

309
32:04.740 --> 32:07.820
♪That's what made me who I am♪

310
32:07.820 --> 32:11.900
♪The best days of my life♪

311
32:12.540 --> 32:16.820
♪Etched into my heart♪

312
32:30.740 --> 32:34.260
♪If there were a promise♪

313
32:34.740 --> 32:38.580
♪I could still turn down with a smile♪

314
32:39.180 --> 32:43.100
♪Sadly, my wish could not come true♪

315
32:43.300 --> 32:46.940
♪Yet I must still smile through it all♪

316
32:46.940 --> 32:49.420
♪Those things I can't forget♪

317
32:49.420 --> 32:53.660
♪The absurdities I can't let go of fill every page♪

318
32:53.660 --> 32:55.580
♪Building a wall♪

319
32:55.940 --> 32:59.420
♪Trapped in the midst of time♪

320
32:59.420 --> 33:02.900
♪Drifting with the wind♪

321
33:54.920 --> 33:57.000
(On this journey to the capital,)

322
33:58.160 --> 34:01.000
(being at the Emperor's side is like being beside a tiger.)

323
34:01.720 --> 34:03.200
(I fear that one day,)

324
34:03.920 --> 34:07.000
(the Lin family may face extermination)

325
34:07.200 --> 34:09.110
(because of you.)

326
34:09.528 --> 34:11.160
(Though I may be an unworthy grandson,)

327
34:11.360 --> 34:13.760
(I have never done anything to disgrace our family.)

328
34:14.230 --> 34:17.150
(Do you dare swear before our ancestors)

329
34:17.230 --> 34:21.280
(that you've never deceived the Emperor or defied his authority?)

330
34:23.880 --> 34:26.590
(I conducted secret investigations day and night)

331
34:26.616 --> 34:28.360
(and finally obtained conclusive evidence.)

332
34:28.392 --> 34:30.110
(Father's suspicions were correct.)

333
34:30.190 --> 34:32.670
(The man Lin Jinqi took away from the Furong Troupe)

334
34:32.824 --> 34:34.440
(was indeed the deposed Crown Prince.)

335
34:34.670 --> 34:36.230
(The two conspired in secret,)

336
34:36.280 --> 34:38.320
(and Lin Jinqi helped him escape by sea.)

337
34:38.360 --> 34:41.590
(We personally interrogated the boatmen)

338
34:41.590 --> 34:42.760
(and porters involved.)

339
34:42.920 --> 34:44.480
(There is no risk of this being leaked.)

340
34:44.590 --> 34:46.920
(Li Qi, a coroner with the Western City Patrol Office,)

341
34:46.920 --> 34:48.800
(recovered a floating corpse west of the city)

342
34:48.800 --> 34:49.960
(in June of that same year.)

343
34:49.976 --> 34:52.500
(Though it was reported as an accidental drowning while drunk,)

344
34:52.510 --> 34:54.920
(the examination found no foam around the mouth or nose)

345
34:55.000 --> 34:56.280
(and no water in the stomach.)

346
34:56.290 --> 34:58.650
(The victim was killed before being thrown into the water.)

347
34:58.660 --> 34:59.580
(Even more strangely,)

348
34:59.590 --> 35:02.320
(the corpse was missing its left index finger.)

349
35:02.480 --> 35:06.840
(Lin Jinqi's guilt is now established.)

350
35:49.230 --> 35:50.670
Lin Jinqi.

351
36:30.660 --> 36:39.580
(Lin Jinqi's guilt is now established.)

352
37:38.630 --> 37:39.320
Xingtang.

353
37:41.880 --> 37:43.710
I burned the gift

354
37:44.360 --> 37:45.230
you gave me,

355
37:48.880 --> 37:50.960
but I won't let your kindness go to waste.

356
37:52.550 --> 37:53.960
I'll make sure I live well.

357
38:30.030 --> 38:31.360
Your wound must hurt.

358
38:33.280 --> 38:34.440
Hold on a little longer.

359
38:35.448 --> 38:36.670
Outside, things are now...

360
38:40.070 --> 38:41.280
You're finally awake.

361
38:45.400 --> 38:46.880
I have good news for you.

362
38:48.070 --> 38:49.960
The Emperor defeated Prince Han.

363
38:56.670 --> 38:57.360
What's wrong?

364
39:04.360 --> 39:06.000
I'm speechless with joy.

365
39:12.280 --> 39:13.630
Congratulations, Young Master Lin.

366
39:14.070 --> 39:15.440
Your head

367
39:16.070 --> 39:16.920
is safe.

368
39:20.480 --> 39:21.920
Is there anything

369
39:23.320 --> 39:24.880
you want to say to me?

370
39:39.230 --> 39:40.400
That's Xingtang.

371
39:41.550 --> 39:42.360
She

372
39:44.480 --> 39:45.070
died.

373
39:50.800 --> 39:52.230
Is there anything else

374
39:53.480 --> 39:54.840
you want to say to me?

375
39:55.400 --> 39:56.840
It's very chaotic outside now.

376
39:57.360 --> 39:58.670
Prince Han's remaining troops

377
39:59.030 --> 40:00.110
have turned to banditry.

378
40:01.280 --> 40:03.230
Xingtang was unfortunate enough to encounter them

379
40:04.000 --> 40:05.190
and was badly wounded.

380
40:06.072 --> 40:08.280
She struggled on with me until we reached this place,

381
40:10.030 --> 40:11.760
but she couldn't hold on any longer.

382
40:15.590 --> 40:16.510
Anything else?

383
40:18.960 --> 40:19.880
What else is there?

384
40:34.940 --> 40:37.300
♪Look at us♪

385
40:38.020 --> 40:42.260
♪We've shared countless beautiful moments♪

386
40:43.860 --> 40:48.780
♪Through life's winding road, we've weathered countless trials♪

387
40:50.230 --> 40:51.030
And

388
40:54.480 --> 40:56.000
I will spend my entire life

389
40:56.880 --> 40:57.670
remembering

390
40:58.840 --> 41:01.110
that you saved my life.

391
41:02.300 --> 41:05.260
♪There will always be someone to share it with♪

392
41:05.260 --> 41:08.180
♪Our bond runs deep♪

393
41:08.660 --> 41:12.140
♪Binding us closely together♪

394
41:12.540 --> 41:15.500
♪After all the questions life has brought♪

395
41:15.500 --> 41:19.300
♪This love has never faded in the slightest♪

396
41:22.880 --> 41:23.590
Wei.

397
41:24.230 --> 41:25.360
Since you're already here,

398
41:26.030 --> 41:27.670
why bother hiding?

399
41:41.440 --> 41:43.440
You must have heard by now

400
41:44.110 --> 41:45.510
that Prince Han has been defeated.

401
41:45.600 --> 41:47.150
Your head will make a fitting offering

402
41:47.150 --> 41:48.400
to honor Prince Han!

403
41:55.590 --> 41:57.190
You have the advantage in numbers.

404
41:58.070 --> 41:59.550
I'm in no condition to resist.

405
42:00.360 --> 42:02.110
But I have a few words to say.

406
42:02.760 --> 42:04.070
Please let me finish.

407
42:06.000 --> 42:06.630
Speak.

408
42:07.920 --> 42:09.760
I helped His Majesty ascend the throne,

409
42:10.400 --> 42:12.400
and I'm one of his trusted ministers.

410
42:12.630 --> 42:13.760
Today,

411
42:13.960 --> 42:16.440
you could certainly kill me and walk away.

412
42:17.030 --> 42:18.630
But what about your parents,

413
42:18.952 --> 42:20.030
your wife and children,

414
42:20.840 --> 42:21.920
and the rest of your family?

415
42:23.440 --> 42:24.960
They can't escape.

416
42:25.480 --> 42:26.510
When the time comes,

417
42:26.960 --> 42:29.400
they'll surely pay with their lives for what you've done.

418
42:30.888 --> 42:32.630
The winners rule. The losers pay the price.

419
42:33.224 --> 42:34.360
I accept the consequences.

420
42:43.960 --> 42:45.630
You're still in the prime of your life,

421
42:46.800 --> 42:48.360
and a fine man at that.

422
42:49.230 --> 42:51.510
Are you really willing to become an outlaw,

423
42:52.232 --> 42:54.580
spend the rest of your life robbing, burning, and killing,

424
42:54.800 --> 42:56.510
bring shame upon your ancestors,

425
42:56.744 --> 42:58.900
and leave no descendants to carry on your family line?

426
42:58.920 --> 42:59.760
Captain Wei.

427
43:05.380 --> 43:07.500
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

428
43:14.190 --> 43:15.710
We're both still young.

429
43:20.190 --> 43:21.760
We have plenty of time

430
43:23.670 --> 43:25.440
to truly get to know each other.

431
43:39.880 --> 43:41.030
Between you and me,

432
43:42.150 --> 43:43.880
there are too many barriers.

433
43:45.550 --> 43:46.710
You and I

434
43:48.392 --> 43:49.576
walk different paths.

435
44:05.981 --> 44:10.101
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

436
44:12.941 --> 44:17.461
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

437
44:18.741 --> 44:22.661
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

438
44:23.341 --> 44:26.101
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

439
44:26.821 --> 44:29.141
♪Though all the world may fade♪

440
44:29.141 --> 44:32.221
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

441
44:33.741 --> 44:37.981
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

442
44:40.901 --> 44:45.061
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

443
44:46.861 --> 44:50.421
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

444
44:50.421 --> 44:53.981
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

445
44:54.781 --> 45:00.461
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

446
45:00.821 --> 45:05.141
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

447
45:05.501 --> 45:08.461
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

448
45:08.461 --> 45:12.221
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

449
45:12.221 --> 45:15.101
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

450
45:15.101 --> 45:19.181
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

451
45:19.181 --> 45:22.541
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

452
45:22.541 --> 45:26.301
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

453
45:26.301 --> 45:30.301
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

454
45:31.061 --> 45:35.221
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

455
45:35.221 --> 45:38.661
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

456
45:38.661 --> 45:42.301
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

457
45:42.301 --> 45:45.181
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

458
45:45.181 --> 45:49.261
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

459
45:49.261 --> 45:52.621
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

460
45:52.621 --> 45:56.261
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

461
